``` 
Detection: Repeated failed logon attempts (possible brute force)
MITRE ATT&CK: T1110.001 - Brute Force: Password Guessing
Data source: WinEventLog:Security (EventCode 4625)
```

index="endpoint" EventCode=4625
| stats count AS failed_attempts min(_time) AS first_attempt max(_time) AS last_attempt BY Account_Name, ComputerName
| where failed_attempts > 10
| convert ctime(first_attempt) ctime(last_attempt)
| sort -failed_attempts
